// Alpha3's own ReShadeUI.fxh (GPL-3, part of Alpha3): the __UNIFORM_<KIND>_<TYPE> macros effects put in their
// uniforms' annotations, each the control the overlay shows for it. Written for Alpha3 to the names effects use;
// ReShade 4 and later read ui_type as is, so every macro is that annotation.

